# The CSP hash gate (scripts/check-csp-hashes.mjs) hashes index.html's inline
# scripts byte-for-byte, and those hashes are pinned in vercel.json's
# Content-Security-Policy. A CRLF working copy (Windows + autocrlf) made local
# hashes differ from the LF blob that CI/Vercel build from, failing deploys.
# Force LF so every environment builds — and hashes — identical bytes.
index.html text eol=lf
